    {
      "text": "Figure 5: Excerpt from the Evaluation Theory Tree (ETT). Shows the hierarchical decomposition of Process Model Comprehension into two Perspectives (Modeler and Reader), eight Quality Criteria (Modeling Process, Domain, Model, Language, Representation, Comprehension, Learning, Perception), and leaf Quality Metrics (e.g., Modeler Documentation Expertise, Creation Duration, Syntactic Validity, Vocabulary Size, Number of Start Events, Flesch Reading Ease Score, Visually Perceivable Loops).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
